{"content_hash": "d9754cc3d36d9e52", "version_id": 823, "article_id": 83, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "OnePlus launches Ace 7 series with big battery and 185Hz screen", "title_zh": "一加发布 Ace 7 系列：大电池加 185Hz 高刷屏", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "toodaylab", "source_url": "https://www.toodaylab.com/84273", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NHx8YWNlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM0MDgzMDd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(269, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(307, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "cb8d01654671"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-31", "word_count": 213, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "OnePlus has launched two new phones, the Ace 7 Pro and the Ace 7. Both come with a huge battery and a fast screen, and they are built for gamers.", "lead_zh": "一加推出了两款新手机：Ace 7 Pro 和 Ace 7。两款机型都配有大容量电池和高刷屏幕，并且主打游戏体验。", "preview": "On October 29, OnePlus introduced the Ace 7 series, which includes the Ace 7 Pro and the standard Ace 7. The phones come in classic black an", "preview_zh": "10 月 29 日，一加发布了 Ace 7 系列，包括 Ace 7 Pro 和标准版 Ace 7。新机有经典的黑白两色，还新增了“破风”和“淬火”两种配色。虽然两款机型外观相似，但 Pro 版采用了特殊的叠层玻璃后盖。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 804, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 81.325, "size_bytes": 488880, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 246, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@d92c8fa/content/data/versions/823.json", "paragraphs": ["On October 29, OnePlus introduced the Ace 7 series, which includes the Ace 7 Pro and the standard Ace 7. The phones come in classic black and white, plus two new colours called Pofeng and Cuihuo. Although both models look similar, the Pro version has a special layered glass back.", "Both phones are dust and water resistant and have metal frames. They also carry a light ring around the camera area, because OnePlus wants to create a gaming feel. The screen runs at 185Hz, so games look smooth, and the eye-care features help reduce tired eyes.", "The Ace 7 Pro uses the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, while the Ace 7 uses a V Series version of the same chip. Both phones have a new cooling system, so performance stays strong. They also include special chips for display and network, which make games faster and connections more stable.", "The series brings a 200-megapixel main camera, and the Pro adds a 3.5x telephoto lens with up to 120x zoom. Both phones have a 9000mAh battery with 100W fast charging. The Ace 7 Pro starts at 3,649 yuan, and the Ace 7 starts at 3,249 yuan.", "OnePlus also sells a magnetic case for 99 yuan, or 69 yuan if you buy it with a phone."], "paragraphs_zh": ["10 月 29 日，一加发布了 Ace 7 系列，包括 Ace 7 Pro 和标准版 Ace 7。新机有经典的黑白两色，还新增了“破风”和“淬火”两种配色。虽然两款机型外观相似，但 Pro 版采用了特殊的叠层玻璃后盖。", "两款手机都具备防尘防水能力和金属中框。摄像头区域还配有一圈呼吸灯，因为一加想营造电竞氛围。屏幕刷新率达到 185Hz，游戏画面更顺滑，护眼功能也有助于缓解眼睛疲劳。", "Ace 7 Pro 搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版芯片，Ace 7 则采用同架构的 V Series 版本。两款手机都配有全新散热系统，性能释放更稳定。它们还加入了显示和网络专用芯片，让游戏更快、连接更稳。", "该系列配备 2 亿像素主摄，Pro 版还增加了 3.5 倍潜望长焦，最高支持 120 倍变焦。两款手机都内置 9000mAh 电池，支持 100W 快充。Ace 7 Pro 起售价 3649 元，Ace 7 起售价 3249 元。", "一加还推出了磁吸保护壳，售价 99 元，和手机一起购买则为 69 元。"], "body": "On October 29, OnePlus introduced the Ace 7 series, which includes the Ace 7 Pro and the standard Ace 7. The phones come in classic black and white, plus two new colours called Pofeng and Cuihuo. Although both models look similar, the Pro version has a special layered glass back.\n\nBoth phones are dust and water resistant and have metal frames. They also carry a light ring around the camera area, because OnePlus wants to create a gaming feel. The screen runs at 185Hz, so games look smooth, and the eye-care features help reduce tired eyes.\n\nThe Ace 7 Pro uses the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, while the Ace 7 uses a V Series version of the same chip. Both phones have a new cooling system, so performance stays strong. They also include special chips for display and network, which make games faster and connections more stable.\n\nThe series brings a 200-megapixel main camera, and the Pro adds a 3.5x telephoto lens with up to 120x zoom. Both phones have a 9000mAh battery with 100W fast charging. The Ace 7 Pro starts at 3,649 yuan, and the Ace 7 starts at 3,249 yuan.\n\nOnePlus also sells a magnetic case for 99 yuan, or 69 yuan if you buy it with a phone.", "body_zh": "10 月 29 日，一加发布了 Ace 7 系列，包括 Ace 7 Pro 和标准版 Ace 7。新机有经典的黑白两色，还新增了“破风”和“淬火”两种配色。虽然两款机型外观相似，但 Pro 版采用了特殊的叠层玻璃后盖。\n\n两款手机都具备防尘防水能力和金属中框。摄像头区域还配有一圈呼吸灯，因为一加想营造电竞氛围。屏幕刷新率达到 185Hz，游戏画面更顺滑，护眼功能也有助于缓解眼睛疲劳。\n\nAce 7 Pro 搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版芯片，Ace 7 则采用同架构的 V Series 版本。两款手机都配有全新散热系统，性能释放更稳定。它们还加入了显示和网络专用芯片，让游戏更快、连接更稳。\n\n该系列配备 2 亿像素主摄，Pro 版还增加了 3.5 倍潜望长焦，最高支持 120 倍变焦。两款手机都内置 9000mAh 电池，支持 100W 快充。Ace 7 Pro 起售价 3649 元，Ace 7 起售价 3249 元。\n\n一加还推出了磁吸保护壳，售价 99 元，和手机一起购买则为 69 元。", "text": "On October 29, OnePlus introduced the Ace 7 series, which includes the Ace 7 Pro and the standard Ace 7. The phones come in classic black and white, plus two new colours called Pofeng and Cuihuo. Although both models look similar, the Pro version has a special layered glass back. Both phones are dust and water resistant and have metal frames. They also carry a light ring around the camera area, because OnePlus wants to create a gaming feel. The screen runs at 185Hz, so games look smooth, and the eye-care features help reduce tired eyes. The Ace 7 Pro uses the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, while the Ace 7 uses a V Series version of the same chip. Both phones have a new cooling system, so performance stays strong. They also include special chips for display and network, which make games faster and connections more stable. The series brings a 200-megapixel main camera, and the Pro adds a 3.5x telephoto lens with up to 120x zoom. Both phones have a 9000mAh battery with 100W fast charging. The Ace 7 Pro starts at 3,649 yuan, and the Ace 7 starts at 3,249 yuan. OnePlus also sells a magnetic case for 99 yuan, or 69 yuan if you buy it with a phone.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用于新产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "series", "pos": "noun", "zh": "系列", "note": "单复数同形", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "standard", "pos": "adj", "zh": "标准的", "note": "standard version 指标准版", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "resistant", "pos": "adj", "zh": "抗……的", "note": "water resistant 防水", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "frame", "pos": "noun", "zh": "边框；框架", "note": "metal frame 金属中框", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "smooth", "pos": "adj", "zh": "顺滑的", "note": "形容画面或手感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "performance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "性能", "note": "常与 strong 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "稳定的", "note": "形容网络或状态", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "telephoto", "pos": "adj", "zh": "长焦的", "note": "摄影术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "magnetic", "pos": "adj", "zh": "磁吸的", "note": "magnetic case 磁吸保护壳", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-31T00:58:25.335332", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "October", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.75, "sm": 375, "em": 750, "cs": 3, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "29", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.45, "sm": 750, "em": 1450, "cs": 11, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.45, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1450, "em": 1550, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}